==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
*2 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is a difficulty spike in comparison to the last few stages. Cadaver bears disrupt your backlines if let burrow, so it's imperative to get a cat to stop them from doing such. Lord Gravey is a powerful opponent who will knock back your melee units, so stack units with more than 250 range, like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs]], though [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is better suited for juggling multiple enemies at once. If you can stop the bears from burrowing, it is possible to endlessly stall all the enemies with enough meatshields so your rangers can attack, but the hard part comes in having to do that twice for the revive ability, so potentially bring a cat that can stop that, or else one of the 4 enemies can sneak deep into your lines. Recommended to have at least 1 Zombie fruit from CotC.

